{
  "id": "1CO.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Abakorinto 14",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uburyo impano y'ubuhanuzi irusha iy'indimi kuba ingenzi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushimikire urukundo kandi mwifuze impano z'Umwuka, ariko cyane cyane mwifuze guhanura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvuga ururimi rutamenyekana si abantu abwira keretse Imana, kuko ari ntawumva ahubwo mu mwuka avuga amayoberane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko uhanura we abwira abantu ibyo kubungura n'ibyo kubahugura, n'ibyo kubahumuriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvuga ururimi rutamenyekana ariyungura, ariko uhanura yungura Itorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakunda ko mwese muvuga izindi ndimi, ariko ibirutaho ko muhanura. Uhanura aruta uvuga izindi ndimi, keretse azisobanuye kugira ngo Itorero ryunguke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko none bene Data, ninza iwanyu mvuga indimi zitamenyekana nzabamarira iki, nintababwira ibyo mpishuriwe cyangwa ibyo mpawe kumenya, cyangwa guhanura cyangwa kwigisha?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore ibidafite ubugingo na byo bigira amajwi, ari umwironge cyangwa inanga, ariko iyo bidatandukanije amajwi yabyo, babwirwa n'iki ikivuzwa cyangwa igicurangwa icyo ari cyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n'impanda na yo ivuze ijwi ritamenyekana, ni nde wakwitegura gutabara? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe ni uko, ururimi rwanyu nirutavuga ibimenyekana, bazabwirwa n'iki ibyo muvuga ibyo ari byo, ko muzaba mugosorera mu rucaca? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indimi zo mu isi nubwo ari nyinshi zite nta rudafite uko rusobanurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ntamenye uko ururimi rusobanurwa, nabera uvuga umunyamahanga kandi n'uvuga na we yambera umunyamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero namwe ubwo mushimikira kubona impano z'Umwuka, abe ari ko murushaho gushishikarira kuzūnguza Itorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko uvuga ururimi rutamenyekana asabe, kugira ngo ahabwe no gusobanura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo nsenga mu rurimi rutamenyekana umwuka wanjye urasenga, ariko ubwo bwenge bwanjye ntibugira icyo bwungura abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko noneho ngire nte? Nzajya nsengesha umwuka wanjye ariko kandi nzajya nsengesha n'ubwenge, nzaririmbisha umwuka wanjye ariko kandi nzaririmbisha n'ubwenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utabikoze nawe ugashima Imana uyishimishije umwuka wawe wonyine, umuntu uri mu ruhande rw'injiji akaba atamenye icyo uvuze, yabasha ate kwikiriza ati “Amen”, umaze gushima? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku bwawe uba ushimye neza koko, ariko wa wundi nta cyo aba yungutse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshimira Imana yuko mwese mbarusha kuvuga indimi zitamenyekana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ariko mu iteraniro aho kuvuga amagambo inzovu mu rurimi rutamenyekana, nahitamo kuvuga amagambo atanu nyavugishije ubwenge bwanjye, kugira ngo nigishe n'abandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Data, ntimube abana bato ku bwenge, ahubwo mube abana b'impinja ku bibi, ariko ku bwenge mube bakuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.11+ISA.28.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 28.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Byanditswe mu mategeko ngo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero Itorero ryose iyo riteraniye hamwe, bose bakavuga indimi zitamenyekana hakinjiramo abatarajijuka cyangwa abatizera, ntibazavuga ko musaze? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko bose niba bahanura, hakinjiramo utizera cyangwa injiji, yakwemezwa ibyaha bye na bose akarondorwa na bose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ibihishwe byo mu mutima we bikērurwa, maze yakwikubita hasi yubamye akaramya Imana, kandi akamamaza yuko Imana iri muri mwe koko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gahunda ikwiriye kuba mu materaniro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bene Data, iyo muteranye bimera bite? Umuntu wese afite indirimbo cyangwa amagambo yo kwigisha, cyangwa amagambo ahishuriwe, cyangwa ururimi rutamenyekana, cyangwa amagambo yo kurusobanura. Nuko rero byose bikorerwe kugira ngo abantu bunguke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niba hariho abavuga ururimi rutamenyekana, havuge babiri cyangwa batatu badasaga, kandi bavuge bakurikirana umwe asobanure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.27",
